  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nmod = 998244353\r\nma = 2*(10**5)\r\nma+=1\r\n\r\ninv = [0]*ma\r\ninv[1] = 1\r\nfor i in range(2,ma):\r\n    inv[i] = (mod-mod//i)\r\n    inv[i]=(inv[i]*inv[mod%i])%mod\r\n\r\nx = [0]*ma\r\nfor i in range(1,ma):\r\n    x[i] = (inv[i]+x[i-1])%mod\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(int(input())):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    ans = 0\r\n    for i in range(n):\r\n        c = (x[i]+x[n-i-1])%mod\r\n        temp=c*a[i]\r\n        ans = (ans+temp)%mod\r\n    print(ans)",
